See https://github.com/void-linux/void-packages/issues/57735
See https://github.com/void-linux/void-packages/pull/62739

This is a quick hack to make thin-provisioning-tools-1.0.4 compile for musl

Note: the patches/fix-musl.patch file is applied regardless of the libc and has
what appear to be rust conditionals within the source files to choose the right
code, since I don't use rust I'm not confident of getting this right and I have
elected to create my patch under files/ and apply it from the post-patch hook,
then we don't have to worry about conditionals, as it's only applied for musl

